      "writtenOn": "2022-11-08T17:11:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is really cool, and a feature that I think many have been hoping for for a long time.\n\nI was wondering if there is any plan to extend this to be able to change review-state of a stack? I think that would be very appreciated (at least by our users).\n\nI found this while writing an issue for the dashboard, so there is a related issue for it.\n\nhttps://bugs.chromium.org/p/gerrit/issues/detail?id\u003d16403",
      "revId": "2cd7ab5f9ac9802d60f91c526d9f825d053034b2",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0cdb3856_8ccf275b",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 29
