        "id": 1119195
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-10T14:20:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah we would like to add more actions but for now we only have actions we thought would be most popular for doing in bulk. It would be nice to have WIP/Active, Private/Public, Abandon/Restore, etc eventually.\n\nBefore adding more we need to change up the UI to be some kind of dropdown list of actions instead of having separate buttons for each one, otherwise it would get too crowded with more actions.",
      "parentUuid": "9abe02e1_9a406b86",
      "revId": "2cd7ab5f9ac9802d60f91c526d9f825d053034b2",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
